                                "sense_id": "2787ce89-0b1f-3885-ac6e-8fcf5852fbf9",
                                "text": "[…] every gamester will agree how necessary it is to know exactly the play of another, in order to countermine him."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "39a48a0a-107e-3eac-84a0-a77513d2d597",
